Z||000000||HAGS||02-21-2001||08:40 AM||||Im between Fieros and couldnt find any really good ones in my area (saw one while towing mine but friend wouldnt stop...(other fiero was at light)) so I bought a 91' Mercury Camri XR2, only a 1.6L but Turbocharged, its a quick little sucker, I think its something like 130 HP??  Big improvement over my dead Iron Duke.  Sorry I dont have any pictures, forgot the digital camera from home for the 3rd time in a row...but its looks like an XR2, gots lots of goodies that came with it, just happend to be my best friend's mom's car....at first when I passed it I thought it was an MR2, I didnt really want to buy an MR2 but I needed a car bad and today, so I stopped in and was relieved to see it was an XR2  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I love this convertible but dont be suprised to see me in an LS-1 85' GT in 4-5 years.<P>If anyone needs parts off an 86' SC I will try to get them off next time I go back home, already applying for transfer to move back so I can work on my stuff more (live in apartment complex here).||||reg||6
